    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Pelvoryn is centered at -12.747544, 11.486657 under Meritocracy, with 84,485,000 people across 8 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Pelvoryn occupies 5,842,768.27 sq mi / 15,132,700.36 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 2.966813% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Partial forest, Farming and Beach and grass with water define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Partial forest and Beach and grass with water. Population density is 5.583 people/sq km / 14.460 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Harengon, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin, Centaur, Giff, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Black-Maw Myriad, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Bastveig, Thoryn-Rahek, Marduthor, Sigrananna, and 3 more.",
